[00:13.28]1. Life depends on Jehovah’s Word,
[00:19.90]All the things he has said.
[00:25.50]We must live not on bread alone;
[00:31.08]Live by his Word instead.
[00:38.54]Even now we have peace and joy,
[00:43.10]Future blessings assured.
[00:50.30](Chorus)
[00:50.34]Man must live not on bread alone;
[00:55.14]Life depends on God’s Word.
[01:02.06]There we find what we daily need;
[01:07.50]Life depends on God’s Word.
[01:16.08]2. True accounts in God’s written Word
[01:21.08]Tell about those of old.
[01:27.26]Men and women who walked in faith—
[01:33.00]They were loyal and bold.
[01:38.38]We’re encouraged each time we read
[01:44.26]All they did and endured.
[01:50.56](Chorus)
[01:50.80]Man must live not on bread alone;
[01:57.60]Life depends on God’s Word.
[02:02.58]There we find what we daily need;
[02:08.72]Life depends on God’s Word.
[02:17.20]3. Day by day as we read God’s Word,
[02:44.54]He gives comfort and hope.
[02:52.02]When the trials of life arise,
[02:57.50]He gives wisdom to cope.
[03:05.14]May we treasure within our heart
[03:11.36]All we’ve read and we’ve heard.
[03:18.02](Chorus)
[03:18.18]Man must live not on bread alone;
[03:23.04]Life depends on God’s Word.
[03:29.36]There we find what we daily need;
[03:39.24]Life depends on God’s Word.
